{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"后半段逐渐把主线转向渴望对方给予回应、成为对方特别珍惜的人，以及一起过日子的愿望。失去亲密的痛楚因此逐渐具体化为得不到相互确认、无法实现共同生活的遗憾，超出了 Center 所指的亲密幸福与留不住它的痛楚本身。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"中后段多次把失去亲密具体化为对方不再需要自己的陪伴，并围绕自己是否被需要、能否继续陪伴展开。这在一定程度上缩窄了 Center 的范围，但仍然服务于亲密可能消失的痛楚。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y 始终让相处时的幸福与对它可能消失的难过相互牵动：越享受亲近，越舍不得；越感到幸福，越意识到无法保证它延续。X 虽然也有这两面，但逐渐转向追求对方回应和共同生活，主线发生了更明显的偏移。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "095304ef-c8a7-42ac-a40b-63e968eadb46", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T074824475231Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.172, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:49:04.649797+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3dc8794bdb0b6b72dc8d3f66ef5c06f9e3ab092edbe7a2f133ec26b8c373dc1e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700